        "reference": "Job 13:1",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "What ye know, the same do I know also: I am not inferior unto you.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 14,
            "end": 22
          },
          {
            "start": 41,
            "end": 43
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 13:2",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Surely I would speak to the Almighty, and I desire to reason with God.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 13:3",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
